================================================================================
OPEN-SOURCE FONT NOTICES (SIL OPEN FONT LICENSE 1.1)
================================================================================

The font files located in `data/fonts/` (`Carlito.ttf` and `Tactical_HUD.ttf`)
are distributed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(https://openfontlicense.org). Full license texts are provided alongside the
font files in `Carlito-OFL.txt` and `Tactical_HUD-OFL.txt`.

1. Carlito.ttf (8x8 Pixel Cyrillic & Latin Fallback Font)
   Copyright (c) 2026 neoru-droid
   An original 8x8 pixel-grid typeface created from scratch for Russian and
   multilingual UI rendering. Distributed under the filename `Carlito.ttf`
   strictly to satisfy the game engine's hardcoded Cyrillic fallback path
   (`fonts/Carlito.ttf`), without incorporating glyphs or data from tyPoland's
   Carlito typeface.
   Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

2. Tactical_HUD.ttf (Tactical HUD Regular, derived from Play)
   Original Play typeface: Copyright (c) 2011, Jonas Hecksher, Playtypes,
   e-types AS (lasse@e-types.com), with Reserved Font Name 'Play', 'Playtype',
   'Playtype Sans'.
   Vertical metrics adjusted and renamed to 'Tactical HUD' (`Tactical_HUD.ttf`)
   in compliance with Section 3 of the SIL Open Font License.
   Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
